        <h1>Is It Safe to Paste Your SQL Into an <em>Online Formatter?</em></h1>
        <p class="dek">A messy query is easy to fix, but the tool you fix it in matters. Some online SQL formatters send your query to a server, table names, credentials, business logic and all. Here is what formatting and validation actually do, which dialect to pick, and why the Best Answer Hub SQL Formatter runs entirely in your browser.</p>
